{"id":"f993c3d599ceec3ac9efd98ef31fc6569614e2fc","axis":"silent","repo":"appwrite/appwrite","sha":"f993c3d599ceec3ac9efd98ef31fc6569614e2fc","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"apps/console/e2e/console.mocked.verify-email.spec.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,120 @@","+import type { Models } from '@appwrite.io/console'","+import type { Page } from '@playwright/test'","+import { expect, test } from './fixtures'","+","+/**","+ * An unverified account on the verify-email page, with every verification","+ * email the page requests counted.","+ */","+async function mockUnverifiedAccount(page: Page) {","+  const sent = { count: 0 }","+  const now = '2026-11-17T00:00:00.000Z'","+  const account: Models.User<Models.Preferences> = {","+    $id: 'verify-test-user',","+    $createdAt: now,","+    $updatedAt: now,","+    name: 'Verify Test',","+    email: 'verify@example.com',","+    registration: now,","+    status: true,","+    labels: [],","+    passwordUpdate: now,","+    phone: '',","+    emailVerification: false,","+    phoneVerification: false,","+    mfa: false,","+    prefs: {},","+    targets: [],","+    accessedAt: now,","+  }","+","+  await page.route('**/*', async (route) => {","+    const request = route.request()","+    const url = new URL(request.url())","+    const localOrigin = new URL(String(test.info().project.use.baseURL)).origin","+    const apiPath = url.pathname.match(/^\\/v1(\\/.*)$/)?.[1]","+    if (url.origin === localOrigin && !apiPath) return route.continue()","+","+    const headers = {","+      'access-control-allow-origin': request.headers().origin ?? '*',","+      'access-control-allow-credentials': 'true',","+      'access-control-allow-methods': 'GET,POST,PUT,PATCH,DELETE,OPTIONS',","+      'access-control-allow-headers':","+        request.headers()['access-control-request-headers'] ?? '*',","+    }","+    if (request.method() === 'OPTIONS' || !apiPath) {","+      return route.fulfill({ status: 204, headers })","+    }","+    const json = (status: number, body: unknown) =>","+      route.fulfill({","+        status,","+        headers: { ...headers, 'content-type': 'application/json' },","+        body: JSON.stringify(body),","+      })","+","+    if (apiPath === '/account' && request.method() === 'GET') {","+      return json(200, account)","+    }","+    if (","+      apiPath === '/account/verifications/email' &&","+      request.method() === 'POST'","+    ) {","+      sent.count += 1","+      const token: Models.Token = {","+        $id: `token-${sent.count}`,","+        $createdAt: now,","+        userId: account.$id,","+        secret: '',","+        expire: now,","+        phrase: '',","+      }","+      return json(201, token)","+    }","+    return json(404, {","+      code: 404,","+      type: 'general_route_not_found',","+      message: 'Mock API response',","+    })","+  })","+","+  return sent","+}","+","+test.describe('verify email', () => {","+  test('sends one email, then waits a minute between resends', async ({","+    page,","+  }) => {","+    await page.clock.install()","+    const sent = await mockUnverifiedAccount(page)","+","+    // Arrange: sign-up lands here, and the page mails the link by itself.","+    await page.goto('/verify-email')","+    await expect.poll(() => sent.count).toBe(1)","+","+    const waiting = page.getByRole('button', { name: /Resend email in \\d+s/ })","+    await expect(waiting).toBeDisabled()","+","+    // Act: spam the button, as in the report.","+    for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {","+      await waiting.click({ force: true })","+    }","+","+    // Assert: still one email.","+    expect(sent.count).toBe(1)","+","+    // A reload neither mails another link nor resets the wait.","+    await page.reload()","+    await expect(waiting).toBeDisabled()","+    expect(sent.count).toBe(1)","+","+    // After a minute the button sends exactly one more email.","+    await page.clock.fastForward('01:01')","+    const resend = page.getByRole('button', {","+      name: 'Resend verification email',","+    })","+    await expect(resend).toBeEnabled()","+    await resend.click()","+    await expect.poll(() => sent.count).toBe(2)","+    await expect(waiting).toBeDisabled()","+  })","+})"],"additions":120,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/console/src/components/global/auth/VerifyEmail.tsx","lines":["@@ -16,6 +16,8 @@ import { useT } from '@/lib/i18n/translate'"," interface VerifyEmailProps {","   onResend?: () => void","   isResendLoading?: boolean","+  /** Seconds until another email may be sent; the resend button waits until it reaches 0. */","+  resendCooldown?: number","   /** Optional redirect path to preserve when linking to sign-in (e.g. / or /projects/xyz) */","   redirect?: string","   /** When 'confirming', only show the verifying message (same card layout as sign-in) */","@@ -27,6 +29,7 @@ interface VerifyEmailProps {"," export function VerifyEmail({","   onResend,","   isResendLoading,","+  resendCooldown = 0,","   redirect,","   status = 'pending',","   preview = false,","@@ -70,9 +73,18 @@ export function VerifyEmail({","                   variant=\"brandCta\"","                   className=\"w-full\"","                   onClick={onResend}","-                  disabled={isResendLoading || isSigningOutToSignIn}","+                  disabled={","+                    isResendLoading ||","+                    isSigningOutToSignIn ||","+                    resendCooldown > 0","+                  }","                 >","-                  {t('Resend verification email')}","+                  {resendCooldown > 0","+                    ? t('Resend email in {seconds}s').replace(","+                        '{seconds}',","+                        String(resendCooldown),","+                      )","+                    : t('Resend verification email')}","                 </Button>","               )}","               {preview ? ("],"additions":14,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/console/src/lib/i18n/dictionaries/he/account-global.ts","lines":["@@ -427,6 +427,7 @@ export const heAccountGlobalDictionary: Record<string, string> = {","   'Remember your password?': 'זוכרים את הסיסמה?',","   'Requested resources': 'משאבים מבוקשים',","   'Resend verification email': 'שליחה חוזרת של אימייל האימות',","+  'Resend email in {seconds}s': 'שליחה חוזרת בעוד {seconds} שניות',","   'Reset password': 'איפוס סיסמה',","   'Reset your password': 'איפוס הסיסמה שלכם',","   'Send recovery link': 'שליחת קישור שחזור',"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/console/src/lib/i18n/dictionaries/ja/account-global.ts","lines":["@@ -309,6 +309,7 @@ export const jaAccountGlobalDictionary: Record<string, string> = {","   'Remember your password?': 'パスワードを覚えていますか?',","   'Requested resources': '要求されたリソース',","   'Resend verification email': '確認メールを再送信',","+  'Resend email in {seconds}s': '{seconds}秒後に再送信できます',","   'Reset password': 'パスワードをリセット',","   'Reset your password': 'パスワードをリセット',","   'Send recovery link': 'リカバリーリンクを送信',"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/console/src/routes/_auth/verify-email.tsx","lines":["@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@","-import { useEffect } from 'react'","+import { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from 'react'"," import {","   useIsMutating,","   useMutation,","@@ -62,10 +62,64 @@ function isInvalidTokenError(error: unknown): boolean {","  */"," const attemptedSecrets = new Set<string>()"," ","-/** Kept per tab, so a remount or reload does not mail another link. */","-const sentKey = (accountId: string) => `verify-email-sent:${accountId}`","+/** When the last link was mailed, kept per tab so a remount or reload neither mails another link nor resets the wait. */","+const sentAtKey = (accountId: string) => `verify-email-sent-at:${accountId}`"," const RESEND_MUTATION_KEY = ['account', 'verification', 'email']"," ","+/** One verification email per minute, as Supabase and Clerk allow. */","+const RESEND_COOLDOWN_MS = 60_000","+","+function readSentAt(accountId: string): number | null {","+  const value = Number(sessionStorage.getItem(sentAtKey(accountId)))","+  return Number.isFinite(value) && value > 0 ? value : null","+}","+","+function isRateLimitError(error: unknown): boolean {","+  return (","+    error instanceof AppwriteException &&","+    error.type === 'general_rate_limit_exceeded'","+  )","+}","+","+/**","+ * Seconds until another verification email may be sent. Every send starts the","+ * wait, including the automatic one when the page opens.","+ */","+function useResendCooldown(accountId: string | undefined) {","+  const [sentAt, setSentAt] = useState<number | null>(() =>","+    accountId && typeof window !== 'undefined' ? readSentAt(accountId) : null,","+  )","+  const [now, setNow] = useState(() => Date.now())","+","+  const secondsLeft =","+    sentAt === null","+      ? 0","+      : Math.max(0, Math.ceil((sentAt + RESEND_COOLDOWN_MS - now) / 1000))","+  const isCoolingDown = secondsLeft > 0","+","+  useEffect(() => {","+    if (!isCoolingDown) return","+    const timer = window.setInterval(() => setNow(Date.now()), 1000)","+    return () => window.clearInterval(timer)","+  }, [isCoolingDown])","+","+  const start = useCallback(() => {","+    if (!accountId) return","+    const at = Date.now()","+    sessionStorage.setItem(sentAtKey(accountId), String(at))","+    setSentAt(at)","+    setNow(at)","+  }, [accountId])","+","+  const clear = useCallback(() => {","+    if (!accountId) return","+    sessionStorage.removeItem(sentAtKey(accountId))","+    setSentAt(null)","+  }, [accountId])","+","+  return { secondsLeft, start, clear }","+}","+"," /** Parse userId and secret from the current URL (used when following email link) so long tokens are not altered by router. */"," function getVerificationParamsFromUrl(): {","   userId: string","@@ -211,6 +265,8 @@ function VerifyEmailPage() {","     },","   })"," ","+  const cooldown = useResendCooldown(accountId)","+","   const resendMutation = useMutation({","     mutationKey: RESEND_MUTATION_KEY,","     mutationFn: async () => {","@@ -227,6 +283,9 @@ function VerifyEmailPage() {","       toast.success(t('Verification email sent'))","     },","     onError: (error: unknown) => {","+      // Nothing was sent, so let the user retry right away. A rate-limited","+      // request keeps the wait: retrying sooner would only be refused again.","+      if (!isRateLimitError(error)) cooldown.clear()","       const message =","         error instanceof AppwriteException","           ? error.message","@@ -235,6 +294,13 @@ function VerifyEmailPage() {","     },","   })"," ","+  // The wait starts before the request, synchronously, so neither a burst of","+  // clicks nor a second mount can send another email while one is in flight.","+  const sendVerification = () => {","+    cooldown.start()","+    resendMutation.mutate()","+  }","+","   // A remount gives this component a new observer that reports an in-flight","   // send as idle, so the button reads pending state from the mutation cache.","   const isResending = useIsMutating({ mutationKey: RESEND_MUTATION_KEY }) > 0","@@ -242,10 +308,9 @@ function VerifyEmailPage() {","   // Sign-up, OAuth2 and sign-in all land here, so this page sends the link;","   // impersonators cannot write to the account.","   useEffect(() => {","-    if (!accountId || sessionStorage.getItem(sentKey(accountId))) return","+    if (!accountId || readSentAt(accountId) !== null) return","     if (hasConsoleImpersonationSessionTarget()) return","-    sessionStorage.setItem(sentKey(accountId), '1')","-    resendMutation.mutate()","+    sendVerification()","   }, [accountId])"," ","   // When landing with userId + secret (from email link), confirm and redirect.","@@ -279,8 +344,12 @@ function VerifyEmailPage() {","       accountSwitcher={<AuthFlowAccountSwitcher />}","     >","       <VerifyEmail","-        onResend={() => resendMutation.mutate()}","+        onResend={() => {","+          if (cooldown.secondsLeft > 0 || isResending) return","+          sendVerification()","+        }}","         isResendLoading={isResending}","+        resendCooldown={cooldown.secondsLeft}","         redirect={search.redirect}","       />","     </AuthFlowShell>",""],"additions":76,"deletions":7,"truncated":false}],"additions":212,"deletions":9,"truncated":false,"file_count":5},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-17T18:44:38.707728+00:00"}